# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Environment variables for the Multi-Modal Evidence Review System
#
# SETUP:
#   1. Copy this file to .env        →   cp .env.example .env
#   2. Put your REAL key in .env     (NOT in this file — .env.example is public)
#   3. .env is gitignored, so the real key is never committed/pushed.
#
# The entire pipeline runs on ONE key. Every model — Claude Opus 4.8 (Stage 3),
# Claude Haiku 4.5 (Stage 1 + repair), Gemini 2.5 Flash + Llama 3.2 Vision
# (consensus) — is reached through OpenRouter with this single key.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Required (the ONLY variable the pipeline needs) ──────────────────────────
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_openrouter_api_key_here
